        lead: 'Gunung Rapat is a set of active temple compounds beside limestone, not one ticketed cave attraction. The official BAS.MY map labels Gunung Rapat and Sam Poh Tong Temple, but it does not confirm which line is useful on your date or whether a stop is beside every entrance.',
